OL,3,GNEWSABristol then and now: Brunel's
OL,4,Abridge and the 'lost' Hippodrome
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsambard Kingdom Brunel famously never
OL,7,Fsaw the Clifton Suspension Bridge
OL,8,Ffinished, after his death in 1859
OL,9,Frobbed him of the chance to see the
OL,10,Fstructure in all its glory. This
OL,11,Fpicture was taken in 1864 as work on
OL,12,Fthe bridge was drawing to a close after
OL,13,Fdelays caused by issues with funding.
OL,14,FIt opened later that year, connecting
OL,15,Fthe Leigh Woods side of the Avon Gorge
OL,16,Fwith Clifton.
